{"id":"599247ab1c6d7e83","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/254_TSTU.md","title":"254 TSTU","display":"254_TSTU","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-类型与符号表\">1. 类型与符号表</h1>\n<p>类型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_{TSTU}=\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ty}_{TSTU}=\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，且不同类型层的变量集合两两不交。</p>\n<p>第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 型变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}=\\{v_i^n:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}=\\{v_i^n:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_{TSTU}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}_{TSTU}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{TSTU}(n,X)=v_m^n\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{TSTU}(n,X)=v_m^n\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 外最小下标。</p>\n<p>项构造子只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{var}_n\\)</span>。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}_n,\\quad\n\\operatorname{mem}_n,\\quad\n\\operatorname{set}_{n+1},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{all}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{eq}_n,\\quad\n\\operatorname{mem}_n,\\quad\n\\operatorname{set}_{n+1},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{all}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq_n t\">\\(s\\doteq_n t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in_n t\">\\(s\\in_n t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_{n+1}(t)\">\\(\\mathsf S_{n+1}(t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall_n x\\,A\">\\(\\forall_n x\\,A\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\vee B:=\\neg A\\to B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\vee B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\wedge(B\\to A),\\quad\n\\exists_n x\\,A:=\\neg\\forall_n x\\,\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\wedge(B\\to A),\\quad\n\\exists_n x\\,A:=\\neg\\forall_n x\\,\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU}\\)</span> 为满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{var}_n(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{var}_n(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的最小集合。</p>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{TSTU}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Term}_{TSTU}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\)</span> 为满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU}\\Rightarrow s\\doteq_n t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU}\\Rightarrow s\\doteq_n t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU},\\ t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{n+1}^{TSTU}\n\\Rightarrow\ns\\in_n t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU},\\ t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{n+1}^{TSTU}\n\\Rightarrow\ns\\in_n t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{n+1}^{TSTU}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mathsf S_{n+1}(t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{n+1}^{TSTU}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mathsf S_{n+1}(t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\Rightarrow\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\Rightarrow\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\Rightarrow A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\Rightarrow A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\forall_n x\\,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\forall_n x\\,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{n+1}^{TSTU}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{n+1}^{TSTU}\\)</span> 定义该层 urelement 公式</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf U_{n+1}(t):=\\neg\\mathsf S_{n+1}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf U_{n+1}(t):=\\neg\\mathsf S_{n+1}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 层没有集合谓词或成员可进入的更低层，因而按句法约定全由基本 urelement 构成；第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 层才由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_{n+1}\">\\(\\mathsf S_{n+1}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf U_{n+1}\">\\(\\mathsf U_{n+1}\\)</span> 互斥划分。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-alpha-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 alpha 等价</h1>\n<p>定义项自由变量：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(\\operatorname{var}_n(x))=\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(\\operatorname{var}_n(x))=\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义公式自由变量：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(s\\doteq_n t)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(s\\doteq_n t)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(s\\in_n t)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(s\\in_n t)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(\\mathsf S_{n+1}(t))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(\\mathsf S_{n+1}(t))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(\\neg A)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(\\neg A)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A\\to B)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A\\to B)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(\\forall_n x\\,A)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(\\forall_n x\\,A)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_{TSTU})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_{TSTU})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(s\\doteq_n t)\n=\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(s\\in_n t)\n=\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(\\mathsf S_{n+1}(t))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(s\\doteq_n t)\n=\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(s\\in_n t)\n=\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(\\mathsf S_{n+1}(t))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(A\\to B)\n=\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(A\\to B)\n=\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(\\forall_n x\\,A)\n=\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(\\forall_n x\\,A)\n=\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义项替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}:\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\n(\\mathsf{Term}_{TSTU}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU})\n\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{TSTU}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}:\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\n(\\mathsf{Term}_{TSTU}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU})\n\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{TSTU}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}_n(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;x=y,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}_n(y),&amp;x\\ne y.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}_n(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;x=y,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}_n(y),&amp;x\\ne y.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义公式替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}:\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\n(\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU})\n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}:\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\n(\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU})\n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(r\\doteq_n t)[x:=s]=r[x:=s]\\doteq_n t[x:=s],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(r\\doteq_n t)[x:=s]=r[x:=s]\\doteq_n t[x:=s],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(r\\in_n t)[x:=s]=r[x:=s]\\in_n t[x:=s],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(r\\in_n t)[x:=s]=r[x:=s]\\in_n t[x:=s],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_{n+1}(t)[x:=s]=\\mathsf S_{n+1}(t[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf S_{n+1}(t)[x:=s]=\\mathsf S_{n+1}(t[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)[x:=s]=A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\to B)[x:=s]=A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\forall_n y\\,A\">\\(C=\\forall_n y\\,A\\)</span>，则同名停止、无捕获进入、捕获风险改名三种情形为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y=x\\Rightarrow C[x:=s]=\\forall_n y\\,A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y=x\\Rightarrow C[x:=s]=\\forall_n y\\,A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(s)\n\\Rightarrow C[x:=s]=\\forall_n y\\,(A[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(s)\n\\Rightarrow C[x:=s]=\\forall_n y\\,(A[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(s)\n\\Rightarrow\nC[x:=s]=\\forall_n z\\,((A[y:=\\operatorname{var}_n(z)])[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(s)\n\\Rightarrow\nC[x:=s]=\\forall_n z\\,((A[y:=\\operatorname{var}_n(z)])[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{TSTU}\n\\bigl(n,\n(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A)\n\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(s)\n\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\cap\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{TSTU}\n\\bigl(n,\n(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A)\n\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU}(s)\n\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\cap\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{TSTU}(A,x,y)\n:=A[x:=\\operatorname{var}_n(y)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{TSTU}(A,x,y)\n:=A[x:=\\operatorname{var}_n(y)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\forall_n x\\,B\">\\(A=\\forall_n x\\,B\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(B)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(B)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{TSTU}(A,x,y)\n:=\\forall_n y\\,(B[x:=\\operatorname{var}_n(y)]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{TSTU}(A,x,y)\n:=\\forall_n y\\,(B[x:=\\operatorname{var}_n(y)]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TSTU}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TSTU}\\)</span> 为与三个原子构造子、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\to,\\forall_n\">\\(\\neg,\\to,\\forall_n\\)</span> 相容并包含每个同类型合法绑定变量改名</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall_n x\\,A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TSTU}\n\\forall_n y\\,(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}_n(y)])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall_n x\\,A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TSTU}\n\\forall_n y\\,(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}_n(y)])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的最小等价关系，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-逻辑公理\">4. 逻辑公理</h1>\n<p>逻辑公理集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{TSTU}\n=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{TSTU}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{TSTU}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{TSTU}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{TSTU}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{TSTU}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{TSTU}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{TSTU}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{TSTU}\n=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{TSTU}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{TSTU}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{TSTU}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{TSTU}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{TSTU}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{TSTU}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{TSTU}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{TSTU}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{TSTU}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{TSTU}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{TSTU}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{TSTU}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{TSTU}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{TSTU}=\\{(\\forall_n x\\,A)\\to A[x:=t]:\nn\\in\\mathbb N,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{TSTU}=\\{(\\forall_n x\\,A)\\to A[x:=t]:\nn\\in\\mathbb N,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{TSTU}=\\{(\\forall_n x\\,(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall_n x\\,B):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},\\\nx\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{TSTU}=\\{(\\forall_n x\\,(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall_n x\\,B):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},\\\nx\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{TSTU}=\\{t\\doteq_n t:n\\in\\mathbb N,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{TSTU}=\\{t\\doteq_n t:n\\in\\mathbb N,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{TSTU}=\\{(t\\doteq_n u)\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u]):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},t,u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{TSTU}=\\{(t\\doteq_n u)\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u]):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},t,u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-TSTU-非逻辑公理\">5. TSTU 非逻辑公理</h1>\n<p>成员右端集合性公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{MemSet}^{TSTU}\n=\n\\{\\forall_n x\\,\\forall_{n+1}y\\,(x\\in_n y\\to\\mathsf S_{n+1}(y)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU},y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{n+1}^{TSTU}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{MemSet}^{TSTU}\n=\n\\{\\forall_n x\\,\\forall_{n+1}y\\,(x\\in_n y\\to\\mathsf S_{n+1}(y)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU},y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{n+1}^{TSTU}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>urelement 无成员公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{UEmpty}^{TSTU}\n=\n\\{\\forall_{n+1}y\\,(\\neg\\mathsf S_{n+1}(y)\\to\n\\forall_n x\\,\\neg(x\\in_n y)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU},y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{n+1}^{TSTU}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{UEmpty}^{TSTU}\n=\n\\{\\forall_{n+1}y\\,(\\neg\\mathsf S_{n+1}(y)\\to\n\\forall_n x\\,\\neg(x\\in_n y)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU},y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{n+1}^{TSTU}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>集合外延公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SetExt}^{TSTU}\n=\n\\{(\\mathsf S_{n+1}(x)\\wedge\\mathsf S_{n+1}(y)\\wedge\n\\forall_n z\\,(z\\in_n x\\leftrightarrow z\\in_n y))\\to x\\doteq_{n+1}y:\nn\\in\\mathbb N,x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{n+1}^{TSTU},z\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SetExt}^{TSTU}\n=\n\\{(\\mathsf S_{n+1}(x)\\wedge\\mathsf S_{n+1}(y)\\wedge\n\\forall_n z\\,(z\\in_n x\\leftrightarrow z\\in_n y))\\to x\\doteq_{n+1}y:\nn\\in\\mathbb N,x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{n+1}^{TSTU},z\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义理解模式的类型限制</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TSTU}(n,A,x,y):\\Longleftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb N\\wedge A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\wedge\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\\wedge y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{n+1}^{TSTU}\\wedge\ny\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TSTU}(n,A,x,y):\\Longleftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb N\\wedge A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\wedge\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\\wedge y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{n+1}^{TSTU}\\wedge\ny\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>集合理解公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Comp}^{TSTU}\n=\n\\{\\exists_{n+1}y\\,(\\mathsf S_{n+1}(y)\\wedge\n\\forall_n x\\,(x\\in_n y\\leftrightarrow A)):\n\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TSTU}(n,A,x,y)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Comp}^{TSTU}\n=\n\\{\\exists_{n+1}y\\,(\\mathsf S_{n+1}(y)\\wedge\n\\forall_n x\\,(x\\in_n y\\leftrightarrow A)):\n\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TSTU}(n,A,x,y)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{TSTU}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{TSTU}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{MemSet}^{TSTU}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{UEmpty}^{TSTU}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SetExt}^{TSTU}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Comp}^{TSTU}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{TSTU}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{TSTU}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{MemSet}^{TSTU}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{UEmpty}^{TSTU}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SetExt}^{TSTU}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Comp}^{TSTU}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则、证明与可导性\">6. 推理规则、证明与可导性</h1>\n<p>显示规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall_n x\\,A},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TSTU}B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall_n x\\,A},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TSTU}B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{TSTU}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{TSTU}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{TSTU}\n=\n\\{((A),\\forall_n x\\,A):n\\in\\mathbb N,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{TSTU}\n=\n\\{((A),\\forall_n x\\,A):n\\in\\mathbb N,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{TSTU}\n=\n\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TSTU}B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{TSTU}\n=\n\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TSTU}B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{TSTU}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{TSTU}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span> 是非空有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU}\\)</span>，并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，至少满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{TSTU}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{TSTU}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=(A_j\\to A_i)\">\\(A_k=(A_j\\to A_i)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\forall_n x\\,A_j\">\\(A_i=\\forall_n x\\,A_j\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(G)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU}(G)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TSTU}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TSTU}A_i\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{TSTU}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{TSTU}A\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{TSTU}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{TSTU}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-整个形式系统\">7. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>目标差异：第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 型对象按句法均为基本 urelement；每个正类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 则由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_{n+1}\">\\(\\mathsf S_{n+1}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf U_{n+1}\">\\(\\mathsf U_{n+1}\\)</span> 区分集合和 urelement。成员右端必须是该正类型层的集合，urelement 没有成员；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TSTU}\">\\(\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TSTU}\\)</span> 又保证理解只从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 型对象形成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 型集合并满足新鲜性。系统不加入 Ambiguity 公理。</p>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{TSTU}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Ty}_{TSTU},\n(\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\n(\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},\n(\\mathsf S_{n+1})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\n(\\mathsf U_{n+1})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{TSTU},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TSTU},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{TSTU},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{TSTU},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{TSTU},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{TSTU},\n\\vdash_{TSTU}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{TSTU}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Ty}_{TSTU},\n(\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TSTU})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\n(\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TSTU})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{TSTU},\n(\\mathsf S_{n+1})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\n(\\mathsf U_{n+1})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T}^{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F}^{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{TSTU},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TSTU},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{TSTU},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{TSTU},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{TSTU},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{TSTU},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{TSTU},\n\\vdash_{TSTU}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含简单类型成员语言、集合谓词、urelement 区分、公理集合、推理规则和证明关系；不含无类型成员、类型歧义公理、解释结构、语义满足、模型类、模型满足关系、真值定义或元定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"i